sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant PWA as PWA Frontend
    participant Supabase as Supabase Auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (Users Table)
    
    Student->>PWA: Enters Credentials
    PWA->>Supabase: signInWithPassword(email, pass)
    Supabase-->>PWA: JWT Token & User ID
    PWA->>DB: Fetch User Profile (Role, Device ID)
    DB-->>PWA: Profile Data
    PWA->>PWA: Verify Device Fingerprint
    alt Device Matches
        PWA-->>Student: Navigate to Dashboard
    else Device Mismatch
        PWA->>Supabase: signOut()
        PWA-->>Student: Show Error "Device Locked"
    end